title: War of the Powers

@certification
# prose-audit: Grade A — The oath crisis is framed from Lewica's role, with institutional pressure hidden behind concrete legal and civic choices.
title: War of the Powers I — the oath
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.trz_certification_event_done = 1;
Q.pres_2020_phase = "Certification contested";
Q.trz_inauguration_status = "President-elect — oath contested";
const margin = Number(Q.pres_runoff_margin) || 0;
const restraint = Number(Q.constitutional_restraint) || 50;
const courtTrust = Number(Q.judicial_legitimacy) || 36;
const pisCapacity = Number(Q.pis_org_resources) || 9;
Q.trz_obstruction_pressure = Math.max(
    20,
    Math.min(
        88,
        Math.round(
            58 - margin * 2.4 +
            Math.max(0, 50 - restraint) * 0.45 +
            Math.max(0, 42 - courtTrust) * 0.30 +
            pisCapacity * 0.65
        )
    )
);
Q.trz_cohabitation_temperature = 24;
Q.news_headline =
    "PiS contests the road from Trzaskowski's victory to the presidential oath";
!}

= August 2020 — The office is not yet his

PiS accepts that votes were counted and attacks every institution that must
turn the result into power. Loyal lawyers challenge the ballot, the Sejm
Marshal delays the National Assembly and government media calls the result
foreign and urban. We must make the oath unavoidable without teaching voters
that presidents take office through our pressure alone.

[? if trz_obstruction_pressure >= 65: The legal challenges, hostile media and
Marshal's delay now reinforce one another; a routine transition is no longer
available.?][? if trz_obstruction_pressure < 65: PiS can obstruct the ceremony,
but the certified count and functioning institutions still give us room to
hold the line.?]

- @certification_legal
- @certification_public
- @certification_bargain

@certification_legal
title: Lock the count behind one constitutional front
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Courts, Senate lawyers and election observers use one record.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A national legal operation requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; trz_certification_strategy = "Constitutional front"; trz_defence_score = 70; judicial_legitimacy += 7; constitutional_restraint += 6; ko_relation += 5; psl_relation += 3; public_trust += 3; rival_relation_pis_ko -= 5; news_headline = "The opposition builds one record around the certified count"
go-to: certification_result

@certification_public
title: Put mayors, unions and voters around the National Assembly
subtitle: Strong public defence; PiS and Konfederacja gain a siege narrative.
on-arrival: trz_certification_strategy = "Civic mobilisation"; trz_defence_score = 64; turnout_readiness += 5; organiser_energy += 4; public_trust += 2; trz_right_backlash += 9; far_right_agenda += 4; konf_poll_momentum += 0.35; pis_poll_momentum += 0.15; rival_relation_pis_konf += 2; news_headline = "A civic cordon demands that the National Assembly meet"
go-to: certification_result

@certification_bargain
title: Let the Palace negotiate the ceremony with PiS
subtitle: Easier oath, but the first compromise is made before the first day in office.
on-arrival: trz_certification_strategy = "Private transition bargain"; trz_defence_score = 57; president_relation += 5; ko_relation -= 3; pis_relation += 4; constitutional_restraint -= 3; trz_cohabitation_temperature -= 5; trz_right_fragmentation += 4; news_headline = "A private transition bargain secures a date and creates a debt"
go-to: certification_result

@certification_result
title: The National Assembly
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.trz_defence_score = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.trz_defence_score) || 0) +
    ((Number(Q.judicial_legitimacy) || 36) - 36) * 0.18 +
    ((Number(Q.constitutional_restraint) || 50) - 50) * 0.16 -
    (Number(Q.trz_obstruction_pressure) || 0) * 0.72
);
if (Q.trz_defence_score >= -7) {
    Q.trz_inaugurated = 1;
    Q.trz_blocked = 0;
    Q.president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski";
    Q.pres_2020_phase = "Cohabitation";
    Q.trz_inauguration_status =
        Q.trz_defence_score >= 10
            ? "Sworn in — certified mandate"
            : "Sworn in — legitimacy disputed";
    Q.trz_cohabitation_temperature +=
        Q.trz_defence_score >= 10 ? 8 : 15;
    Q.trz_right_fragmentation +=
        Q.trz_defence_score >= 10 ? 4 : 8;
    Q.trz_right_backlash +=
        Q.trz_defence_score >= 10 ? 3 : 7;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Rafał Trzaskowski takes the oath before a hostile PiS majority";
} else {
    Q.trz_inaugurated = 0;
    Q.trz_inauguration_status = "Oath delayed";
    Q.pres_2020_phase = "Constitutional interregnum";
    Q.trz_right_backlash += 8;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The Sejm Marshal prevents the oath and opens an interregnum";
}
!}

[? if trz_inaugurated: The joint sitting takes place. PiS deputies turn their
backs during the oath. We have defended the transfer; the new President
immediately inherits a government that treats every signature as enemy action.
?]

[? if not trz_inaugurated: The sitting is not convened. The certified winner
has a mandate but no office, while the Sejm Marshal prepares to exercise the
President's powers after Duda's term expires. Our defence now becomes a choice
between escalation and conceding another ballot. ?]

- @begin_cohabitation
- @force_oath
- @mobilised_oath
- @accept_repeat

@begin_cohabitation
title: Enter cohabitation
view-if: trz_inaugurated = 1
go-to: certification_continue

@force_oath
title: Force a new sitting through the courts and Senate
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. The oath succeeds, but PiS never recognises the settlement.
view-if: trz_inaugurated = 0
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The exhausted opposition cannot finance the legal and parliamentary operation.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; trz_inaugurated = 1; trz_blocked = 0; president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski"; pres_2020_phase = "Cohabitation"; trz_inauguration_status = "Sworn in after constitutional standoff"; trz_cohabitation_temperature += 24; trz_right_fragmentation += 10; trz_right_backlash += 8; judicial_legitimacy += 5; ko_relation += 5; pis_relation -= 8; rival_relation_pis_ko -= 8; news_headline = "A second joint sitting ends the interregnum"

Our lawyers and Senate allies force a second sitting and the certified winner
takes the oath. The office is filled; PiS begins cohabitation by calling the
settlement an opposition seizure.

go-to: certification_continue

@mobilised_oath
title: Break the delay with a permanent civic assembly
subtitle: The oath succeeds amid protests; the radical right leaves with a founding myth.
view-if: trz_inaugurated = 0
on-arrival: trz_inaugurated = 1; trz_blocked = 0; president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski"; pres_2020_phase = "Cohabitation"; trz_inauguration_status = "Sworn in during civic mobilisation"; trz_cohabitation_temperature += 28; trz_right_fragmentation += 7; trz_right_backlash += 15; turnout_readiness += 5; far_right_agenda += 7; konf_poll_momentum += 0.7; pis_poll_momentum += 0.25; minority_safety -= 3; news_headline = "Continuous demonstrations force the National Assembly to meet"

Mayors, unions and voters keep an assembly outside Parliament until the joint
sitting meets. Trzaskowski takes office; the radical right leaves with a
founding story about a presidency installed by the street.

go-to: certification_continue

@accept_repeat
title: Accept a repeat election to avoid a rupture
subtitle: PiS succeeds in keeping the certified winner from office.
view-if: trz_inaugurated = 0
on-arrival: trz_blocked = 1; trz_inaugurated = 0; trz_repeat_election_pending = 1; president_name = "Elżbieta Witek (acting)"; pres_2020_phase = "Repeat election pending"; trz_inauguration_status = "Blocked — repeat election conceded"; party_unity -= 10; public_trust -= 8; constitutional_restraint -= 12; judicial_legitimacy -= 8; pis_relation += 6; ko_relation -= 10; trz_right_backlash += 12; pis_poll_momentum += 0.8; news_headline = "The opposition concedes a repeat presidential election"

We accept a rerun to end the immediate rupture. Witek becomes acting President,
PiS learns that obstruction can erase a certified result and our own voters ask
why they should repeat a victory we did not defend.

go-to: certification_continue

@certification_continue
go-to: poland_leadership_events.p2050_foundation_2020 if p2050_foundation_2020_done = 0; poland_hub

@repeat_election_2020
# prose-audit: Grade A — Lewica's role in the conceded rerun is explicit, forecast scores are hidden, and every campaign choice has an aftermath.
title: The conceded presidential rerun
subtitle: Acting presidential powers end when the repeat ballot produces an office-holder
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 38
order: 10
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2020 and month = 9 and trz_repeat_election_pending = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.trz_repeat_campaign_score =
    44 +
    (Number(Q.media_capacity) || 0) * 0.08 +
    (Number(Q.turnout_readiness) || 0) * 0.06 +
    (Number(Q.ko_relation) || 0) * 0.04 -
    (Number(Q.trz_right_backlash) || 0) * 0.08;
Q.trz_repeat_right_score =
    45 +
    (Number(Q.pis_poll_momentum) || 0) * 2 +
    (Number(Q.trz_right_backlash) || 0) * 0.10 +
    Math.max(0, 45 - (Number(Q.public_trust) || 0)) * 0.08;
Q.news_headline =
    "Witek's acting presidency reaches the promised repeat ballot";
!}

= September 2020 — A second ballot cannot be an interregnum

The first certified result was blocked and the opposition conceded a rerun.
Witek may exercise acting powers only until that process produces a President;
she does not inherit a term. We must decide whether our campaign helps
Trzaskowski defend the stolen result, rebuild the democratic coalition or
refuse a contest that should never have existed.

- @repeat_defend
- @repeat_broaden
- @repeat_withdraw

@repeat_defend
title: Campaign on the certified result and constitutional theft
subtitle: Make the blocked oath the issue, even as the right builds a grievance of its own.
on-arrival: trz_repeat_campaign_score += 5; trz_right_backlash += 3; constitutional_restraint += 3; news_headline = "Trzaskowski makes the blocked oath the rerun's central issue"

We put the first certificate on every platform and force PiS to defend the
interregnum. Democratic voters recover a clear cause; the right converts the
same campaign into proof that the opposition will never accept it.

go-to: repeat_election_count

@repeat_broaden
title: Rebuild the Senate pact into a broad rerun campaign
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Reunite the democratic parties around turnout and a lawful transfer.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A national rerun operation requires one party resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; trz_repeat_campaign_score += 8; ko_relation += 2; psl_relation += 2; turnout_readiness += 2; news_headline = "The democratic parties rebuild a common rerun operation"

Our organisers join KO and PSL around polling stations, turnout and the promise
that the acting presidency will end. Trzaskowski gains the widest operation;
every partner records its share of the rescue.

go-to: repeat_election_count

@repeat_withdraw
title: Withdraw rather than legitimise the rerun
subtitle: Duda wins; constitutional protest rises while democratic trust collapses.
on-arrival: trz_repeat_campaign_score = 0; constitutional_restraint += 2; party_unity -= 5; public_trust -= 4; news_headline = "Trzaskowski withdraws from the repeat ballot"

We refuse to decorate the rerun with democratic consent. The legal protest
remains intact, but Duda takes the office uncontested and voters who expected
us to end the interregnum lose faith in the opposition.

go-to: repeat_election_count

@repeat_election_count
title: The repeat ballot ends the acting presidency
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const repeatVariance =
    Math.floor((this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 7) - 3;
const democraticRaw = Math.max(
    0,
    Number(Q.trz_repeat_campaign_score) + repeatVariance
);
const rightRaw = Math.max(1, Number(Q.trz_repeat_right_score));
Q.trz_repeat_result = Math.round(
    democraticRaw / Math.max(1, democraticRaw + rightRaw) * 1000
) / 10;
Q.trz_repeat_winner = Q.trz_repeat_result >= 50
    ? "Rafał Trzaskowski"
    : "Andrzej Duda";
Q.president_name = Q.trz_repeat_winner;
Q.trz_repeat_election_pending = 0;
if (Q.trz_repeat_winner == "Rafał Trzaskowski") {
    Q.trz_inaugurated = 1;
    Q.trz_blocked = 0;
    Q.pres_2020_phase = "Cohabitation after repeat election";
    Q.trz_inauguration_status = "Sworn in after winning the conceded rerun";
    Q.ko_relation += 4;
    Q.news_headline = "Trzaskowski wins again and the acting presidency ends";
} else {
    Q.trz_inaugurated = 0;
    Q.trz_blocked = 1;
    Q.pres_2020_phase = "Duda presidency after repeat election";
    Q.trz_inauguration_status = "Blocked winner loses the conceded rerun";
    Q.pis_relation += 4;
    Q.news_headline = "Duda wins the rerun and the acting presidency ends";
}
!}

**Rafał Trzaskowski: [+ trz_repeat_result +]% · Andrzej Duda: [+
100 - trz_repeat_result +]%.**

