= October 2020 — A judgment and a hostile President

The disputed Constitutional Tribunal removes the fetal-impairment ground.
Trzaskowski cannot veto a judgment. He can deny the panel political legitimacy,
refer later statutes and promise his signature to a parliamentary repair.

- @tribunal_palace_bill
- @tribunal_movement
- @tribunal_compromise

