= February 2021 — Two centres of legality

PiS packages court appointments, disciplinary rules and public-media changes
as ordinary administration. The Palace calls them one attempt to govern around
the Constitution. Each veto can stop a statute; none can repair the courts.

- @judicial_veto_front
- @judicial_europe
- @judicial_trade

